   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Fund to Fight AIDS, Tuberculosis and Malaria</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening TB control in Kosovo - Kosovo (01-Apr-2016-31-Dec-2018)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kosovo, Tuberculosis, Community Development Fund (CDF)This program has the following goals: To reduce the overall incidence of TB notified cases from 46 per 100000 population in 2016  to 36 per 100000 in 2020. The objectives of this program are: To ensure equitable access to high quality diagnosis, treatment, care and prevention that is integrated and patient-centered, with a focus on vulnerable populations including children, ethnic minorities and on the prison population.  To strengthen health support systems and use community systems to enable needs-based, sustainable and integrated interventions for key populations mostly affected by the TB epidemic</narrative>
  </description>
